{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f2c0de-6a41-4f0e-9c6f-1f9f6a1d3f10",
    "name": "Hotel Offer Orchestrator",
    "description": "Hotel aggregation service: two mock suppliers orchestrated concurrently by a Temporal workflow, deduplicated by hotel name, persisted in Redis and price-filtered with ZRANGEBYSCORE.\n\nSet the `baseUrl` collection variable (default `http://localhost:3000`).\n\n## Simulating a supplier outage\n\nSupplier availability is controlled by environment variables, never by a request parameter:\n\n```bash\nSUPPLIER_A_ENABLED=false docker compose up --build\n# or, on an already running stack\nSUPPLIER_A_ENABLED=false docker compose up -d --force-recreate api worker\n```\n\nWith `SUPPLIER_A_ENABLED=false`, `GET /supplierA/hotels` answers HTTP 503, the Temporal workflow retries it, gives up and returns partial results built only from Supplier B, and `GET /health` reports Supplier A as `disabled`. Disabling both suppliers makes `GET /api/hotels` answer HTTP 502 `SUPPLIERS_UNAVAILABLE`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "supplierAUp",
      "value": "true",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "supplierBUp",
      "value": "true",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Get all Delhi hotels",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?city=delhi",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "hotels"],
          "query": [{ "key": "city", "value": "delhi" }]
        },
        "description": "Runs the Temporal workflow for Delhi, then returns the whole Redis snapshot."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('responds with HTTP 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "const hotels = pm.response.json();",
              "",
              "pm.test('returns a JSON array', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(hotels).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('every entry exposes exactly name, price, supplier, commissionPct', function () {",
              "    hotels.forEach(function (hotel) {",
              "        pm.expect(Object.keys(hotel).sort()).to.eql(['commissionPct', 'name', 'price', 'supplier']);",
              "        pm.expect(hotel.price).to.be.a('number');",
              "        pm.expect(hotel.supplier).to.be.oneOf(['Supplier A', 'Supplier B']);",
              "    });",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('contains no duplicate hotel names', function () {",
              "    const names = hotels.map(function (hotel) { return hotel.name.trim().toLowerCase(); });",
              "    pm.expect(new Set(names).size).to.eql(names.length);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('is sorted by price ascending', function () {",
              "    for (let i = 1; i < hotels.length; i++) {",
              "        pm.expect(hotels[i].price).to.be.at.least(hotels[i - 1].price);",
              "    }",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('overlapping hotel Holtin resolves to the cheaper Supplier B offer', function () {",
              "    const holtin = hotels.find(function (hotel) { return hotel.name.toLowerCase() === 'holtin'; });",
              "    pm.expect(holtin).to.be.an('object');",
              "    pm.expect(holtin.price).to.eql(5340);",
              "    pm.expect(holtin.supplier).to.eql('Supplier B');",
              "    pm.expect(holtin.commissionPct).to.eql(20);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('overlapping hotel Radison resolves to the cheaper Supplier A offer', function () {",
              "    const radison = hotels.find(function (hotel) { return hotel.name.toLowerCase() === 'radison'; });",
              "    pm.expect(radison.price).to.eql(5900);",
              "    pm.expect(radison.supplier).to.eql('Supplier A');",
              "    pm.expect(radison.commissionPct).to.eql(13);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('equal-priced hotel The Leela is awarded to Supplier A', function () {",
              "    const leela = hotels.find(function (hotel) { return hotel.name.toLowerCase() === 'the leela'; });",
              "    pm.expect(leela.price).to.eql(7200);",
              "    pm.expect(leela.supplier).to.eql('Supplier A');",
              "    pm.expect(leela.commissionPct).to.eql(11);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('single-supplier hotels are retained', function () {",
              "    const names = hotels.map(function (hotel) { return hotel.name; });",
              "    pm.expect(names).to.include('Taj Palace');",
              "    pm.expect(names).to.include('Novotel');",
              "    pm.expect(names).to.include('The Oberoi');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
